 "notes": "Wall centrelines from the raster; walls referenced by a dimension snapped to the written value, others interpolated between them. The drawing is not uniformly scaled and its dimensions are not mutually consistent: the top chain gives 4990 and the bottom chain 4900 for walls ~10 px apart; the 790 band (PS strip over bath 1) is drawn ~350 mm deep; the right chain (810/2350/2940/1350 = 7450 from the right block top to the facade) disagrees with the left chain by ~600 mm, so the right block is placed with the left chain (bath 2 bottom ~6320, facade 10040). The 680/510 split tick (714 px) hits no wall; 10040 is taken as the living-room facade. Kitchen: sink run on the top wall from the glazed balcony partition to the right wall (~2.6 m), cooktop run on the right wall, peninsula at the bottom; no fridge drawn. Upper cabinets assumed. Utility sink in the balcony as a fixture."
